data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "synth-2", "text": "Drafted 'rb_sas_pyopticl_fig2a' on a 485x185 mm plate: 5x mirror, 3x half wave plate, 3x beam dump, 2x pbs, 1x sampler, 1x vapor cell, 1x photodiode. Rb-87 saturated absorption spectroscopy at 780 nm using 1-inch mounted optics (reproducing PyOpticL paper Fig. 2a). An input beam is split at PBS1 after HWP1; the reflected spectroscopy branch is steered by M1 onto a 10:90 beam sampler (BS). The 10%"}

