data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "repair-1", "text": "Rationale: Shifted PBS1 and the upper probe path up by 15 mm (raising PBS2 to y=70 mm) so PBS2 and M5 are 40 mm apart without mount collision, and removed the unused BD2 and BD3 dumps."}

