d beam_dump \u2014 Removed unused beam dump that received no light (superseded by BD_auto1 and BD_auto2)."}], "rationale": "Shifted PBS1 and the upper probe path up by 15 mm (raising PBS2 to y=70 mm) so PBS2 and M5 are 40 mm apart without mount collision, and removed the unused BD2 and BD3 dumps."}

